('text.greek.ieleusis71','I.Eleusis 71','I.Eleusis 71 铭文','I.Eleusis 71','I.Eleusis 71','INSCRIPTION','civ.greek','region.mediterranean','ca. mid-fourth century BCE?','厄琉息斯人法令残片；PHI 明确标注并非出自得墨忒耳与科瑞圣区。 / Fragmentary decree of the Eleusinians, explicitly catalogued as not from the sanctuary.','PARTIAL','SOURCE_BACKED',1,'{"witness_role":"INSCRIPTION","findspot_scope":"ELEUSIS_NOT_SANCTUARY"}','2026-08-27T10:00:00Z','2026-08-27T10:00:00Z'),
('text.greek.ieleusis72','I.Eleusis 72','I.Eleusis 72 铭文','I.Eleusis 72','I.Eleusis 72','INSCRIPTION','civ.greek','region.mediterranean','Hellenistic or Roman-period catalogue context; edition date retained separately','厄琉息斯人纪念祭司 Hierokleides 的法令残片；不把城镇出土范围误写为圣区出土。 / Decree honoring the hierophant Hierokleides; Eleusis locality is not collapsed into sanctuary provenance.','PARTIAL','SOURCE_BACKED',1,'{"witness_role":"INSCRIPTION","findspot_scope":"ELEUSIS_NOT_SANCTUARY"}','2026-08-27T10:00:00Z','2026-08-27T10:00:00Z'),
