('site.greece.sacred_way_roman_bridge','Roman Bridge over the Eleusinian Cephissus','厄琉息斯基菲索斯河罗马桥',NULL,NULL,'ARCHAEOLOGICAL_SITE','civ.greek','region.mediterranean','Hadrianic period','圣道接近厄琉息斯入口处保存的罗马时期桥梁；代表路线的一个有年代层，不等于整条道路。 / Preserved Hadrianic bridge near Eleusis, one dated layer of the route rather than the whole road.','PARTIAL','SOURCE_BACKED',1,'{"reality_status":"REAL_ARCHAEOLOGICAL","route_component":true,"phase":"HADRIANIC"}','2026-08-27T10:00:00Z','2026-08-27T10:00:00Z'),
